ory in the creation of game-based systems for upper limb stroke rehabilitation. JMIR Serious Games, 7(2), e12131."}]," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6453078/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":["Read source ",["$","$L10",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$18:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-external-link","size":13}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
