1d:["$","p","OutBrick has no border checkpoint and no moral dilemma. Its meaningful friction is smaller: the board asks you to choose which relationship to preserve. Moving one brick can close a lane, delay a match, or reveal that the apparently obvious move was a trap.",{"children":"OutBrick has no border checkpoint and no moral dilemma. Its meaningful friction is smaller: the board asks you to choose which relationship to preserve. Moving one brick can close a lane, delay a match, or reveal that the apparently obvious move was a trap."}]
1e:["$","p","The interface should not add arbitrary pain to that decision. The challenge belongs in the spatial relationship, not in a hidden timer, unclear icon, or scarce undo. That distinction is the line between friction that produces thought and friction that merely consumes patience.",{"children":"The interface should not add arbitrary pain to that decision. The challenge belongs in the spatial relationship, not in a hidden timer, unclear icon, or scarce undo. That distinction is the line between friction that produces thought and friction that merely consumes patience."}]
1f:["$","ul",null,{"className":"article-bullets","children":[["$","li","Put the difficulty in the idea, not the controls",{"children":"Put the difficulty in the idea, not the controls"}],["$","li","Show enough consequence for choices to matter",{"children":"Show enough consequence for choices to matter"}],["$","li","Let the player recover from an experiment",{"children":"Let the player recover from an experiment"}],["$","li","Keep the goal legible while the route stays open",{"children":"Keep the goal legible while the route stays open"}]]}]
