21:["$","section","let-the-player-name-the-cost",{"id":"let-the-player-name-the-cost","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Let the player name the cost"}],[["$","p","The most memorable systems leave players able to say what they traded away. “I protected this lane and lost that opening.” That sentence makes a puzzle feel like a decision rather than a button sequence.",{"children":"The most memorable systems leave players able to say what they traded away. “I protected this lane and lost that opening.” That sentence makes a puzzle feel like a decision rather than a button sequence."}],["$","p","OutBrick wants the cost to stay small enough for a short session, but real enough that the clear feels earned. A little friction can make a calm game richer when the player remains in control of the meaning.",{"children":"OutBrick wants the cost to stay small enough for a short session, but real enough that the clear feels earned. A little friction can make a calm game richer when the player remains in control of the meaning."}]],null,null,["$","p",null,{"className":"article-source-note","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Research trail"}],[["$","a","papers-please-official",{"href":"#reference-papers-please-official","aria-label":"Jump to source: Pope (n.d.)","children":["[",1,"]"]}],["$","a","motivation-2010",{"href":"#reference-motivation-2010","aria-label":"Jump to source: Przybylski, Rigby, & Ryan (2010)","children":["[",2,"]"]}]]]}]]}]
